			<DisplayName>9M723 Iskander Launcher</DisplayName>
			<Description>The 9M723 Iskander is a Russian short-range ballistic missile system designed for precision strikes against strategic ground targets. This mobile launcher provides rapid deployment capability and features advanced inertial navigation with terminal guidance for high accuracy against fortified positions, command centers, and infrastructure targets.
				10km max range, 5km minimum range.
			</Description>
			<Icon>Textures\Icons\9M723_Iskander\Cubes\LXN_9M723_Launcher_1.dds</Icon>
